<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 106 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 492 0 R
/ActualText (4. Seamless Mixing of Client and Server Components: You can use Server Components and Client Components together in the same React app. Server Components handle static content, while Client Components manage user interaction.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
